WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.574 --> 00:00:02.361
- [Voiceover] People at
work think I'm boring.

00:00:02.361 --> 00:00:04.498
None of them know I'm a nudist.

00:00:04.498 --> 00:00:07.452
(drums playing)

00:00:08.582 --> 00:00:09.932
(whoosh)

00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:15.080
- [Voiceover] The first
naked man I ever saw

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.160
looked like Santa.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.681
I was eight and my mom had accidentally

00:00:17.681 --> 00:00:19.143
brought us to a nudist commune

00:00:19.143 --> 00:00:20.838
instead of a nature camp.

00:00:20.838 --> 00:00:22.266
- [Voiceover] My Nana owns a nudist camp.

00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:23.706
I like to go there and get naked.

00:00:23.706 --> 00:00:25.245
It feels so light and free.

00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:27.514
- [Voiceover] Cooking naked is dangerous.

00:00:27.514 --> 00:00:28.489
Sincerely.

00:00:28.489 --> 00:00:30.614
I've got polka-dotted boobs now.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:31.229
- [Voiceover] Had to give a talk

00:00:31.229 --> 00:00:32.994
at a nudist colony last week.

00:00:32.994 --> 00:00:34.537
Didn't get nervous, I
just pictured them all

00:00:34.537 --> 00:00:35.883
with their clothes on.

00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:37.719
- [Voiceover] Family
nudism is getting more

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:40.172
difficult as our daughter gets older.

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:41.681
- [Voiceover] My roommate is a nudist.

00:00:41.681 --> 00:00:42.993
I was not informed of this before we

00:00:42.993 --> 00:00:44.258
signed the lease.

00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:46.538
Slightly awkward.

00:00:46.538 --> 00:00:47.706
- [Voiceover] My parents just told me

00:00:47.706 --> 00:00:49.622
they're nudists when I'm not around.

00:00:49.622 --> 00:00:51.665
And now want to do it when I'm home.

00:00:51.665 --> 00:00:54.208
Not sure I want to see them naked.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:55.427
- [Voiceover] My
sister-in-law has decided to

00:00:55.427 --> 00:00:56.901
become a home nudist.

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:59.525
Outwardly, I'm saying,
"Well, if you're sure."

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.081
Inwardly, I'm saying, "Woo-hoo!

00:01:01.081 --> 00:01:02.985
"Thank you Jesus!"

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:07.832
("Warm It Up" by Warner /
Chappell Production Music)

00:01:12.396 --> 00:01:14.631
(whoosh)
(creak)

